# Shell scripts must be LF everywhere: bash on WSL rejects CRLF
# (`pipefail\r`), and lane worktrees on mixed hosts otherwise churn line
# endings into every merge. (v0.2.5 T-INFRA; bugeventlog 2026-07-16
# tool-check-unrunnable-from-WSL entry.)
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.bats text eol=lf
